<title>POLAND: COMPUTERLAND TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 63.</title>
<headline>COMPUTERLAND TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 63.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>A kerb transaction in 15,000 shares in Polish computer maker ComputerLand SA at 63 zlotys each was struck on the Warsaw bourse on Tuesday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular session ComputerLand traded at 67 zlotys in a volume of 7,773 shares.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
